Can you even lift it?  If you can't even pick it up, it's likely that
it's a cursed BoH.

If you can lift it, then you can't quite tell.  Now, you are in
Minetown, are you?  Drop it at the alter and see if it's cursed.

If it is not cursed, then you have a bag...try to *just barely* burden
yourself, then put an item (Don't put another bag or unknown wand...)
into the bag after you are barely burdened.  If you unburden yourself
by putting an item into it, it's an uncursed/blessed BoH.

If it is cursed, then, see if you can bring yourself to just *under*
the threashhold of unburdened/burdened, burdened/stressed, or
stressed/overtaxed.  Then, put an item (that you don't care if you lose
it) into the bag.  If your burden status worsen by putting an item into
the bag, then it's a cursed BoH.  

